cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or build on this work, please cite the paper below."
title: "Graph Convolutional Attention: A Spectral Perspective on Graph Denoising and Diffusion"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying the paper. We analyze attention-based graph denoising from a
  spectral perspective, show linear attention learns an average spectral filter,
  and introduce Graph Convolutional Attention (GCA), a permutation-equivariant
  realization that provably improves on linear attention and transfers to
  DiGress-style discrete diffusion.
authors:
